  (label "VIN" (at 22.86 58.42 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6cc4a7dc-d9f3-5166-88a6-eb03ba7e41e0))
  (text "J101 SIG_IN, edge-launch SMA.\nVIN: 50R microstrip on L1 over L2 GND,\nw 0.36 mm (7628 prepreg 0.21 mm),\n6 mm (~37 ps) to K1/Ctop pads.\nGND stitching vias along the line." (at 5.08 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 8e9b0a25-9eb4-5c11-94a1-259859d897e3))
  (no_connect (at 53.34 93.98) (uuid 86b73116-0139-52d7-9ae3-ccd84dc1d146))
  (no_connect (at 43.18 93.98) (uuid 8912125d-b4f9-51ff-a7ed-dd006c5a85c7))
  (hierarchical_label "TERM_50" (shape input) (at 66.04 78.74 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 09fd764e-4206-5cbb-8b7c-4d6fa3cabc91))
  (text "K1 on (TERM_50 low) = 50R:\n2 x 100R 0603 (3 Vrms), one\nper pole, poles in parallel\n(4 nH/pole assumed; one pole\n= +1.7 dB @ 2 GHz).\nVIN-R-K1 stub < 2 mm.\nCoil 3 V: 39R from VBUS -> 3.1 V, 49 mA." (at 96.52 80.01 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 47ac59d0-d55d-53e0-ade0-eca16156c55a))
  (label "GA" (at 121.92 58.42 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3a1a710f-9922-5f76-90b9-87f58e18eccb))
  (text "HF 5:1: Ctop 1.5p / Cbot 3.3p, k = 1.53/(1.53+3.3+2.4+0.3) = 0.206,\nx G 0.971 = 0.200. Ctop-GA-Rg-IN node as small as possible (pads\n~0.3 pF are part of k). Rg 10R (22-33R if step overshoot, RESULT op. 1)." (at 88.9 13.97 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid fb40dd8a-4f44-5198-85fc-4b462c9f35e0))
  (no_connect (at 185.42 63.5) (uuid d97a980b-e511-5b42-9465-8a64843812e6))
  (no_connect (at 185.42 66.04) (uuid 04097b38-0eb2-5889-803a-871958b8ace5))
  (no_connect (at 185.42 68.58) (uuid 8877088c-ffbc-5a69-b29a-9a471ae60587))
  (text "U101 CL mode: Aux_Bias = VS-,\nR_Bias 17.8k (wide-BW mode).\nEP isolated -> GND plane." (at 203.2 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid f5451a47-14d8-5cf9-a466-b6d4a6b36a95))
  (text "CLH = +1.5 V" (at 172.72 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 441579c6-8b47-5ed1-bbc3-da061407b3e7))
  (text "CLL = -1.5 V. Clamps: OUT within +/-1.5 V,\ninput diodes to CLH/VS- (100 mA max)." (at 162.56 114.3 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid b09a1836-0a39-5496-96ff-5fd51f5e6880))
  (hierarchical_label "BUF_OUT_S" (shape output) (at 193.04 53.34 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid d4284f93-eda3-567b-8a45-74c020e1ed57))
  (hierarchical_label "BUF_OUT_T" (shape output) (at 243.84 58.42 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid bc429dea-f9e7-5806-9fe0-1fa004b53a22))
  (text "BUF_OUT_S = U101 OUT node: 10R + sampler bridge on the sampler\nsheet, bridge within 3 mm of the OUT pin (Zout 1.2R + 0.3 nH).\n49.9R directly at the OUT pin, then 0R/ferrite/100R position.\nBUF_OUT_T: 50R microstrip (0.36 mm, 6.06 ps/mm) to TMUX136\n(high-impedance end, trigger_phase): no termination at the far\nend, keep it short (< 30 mm, ~180 ps), no stubs." (at 198.12 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 675e7369-b6d6-5a23-a0f1-ad00de1b16de))
  (label "TAP" (at 60.96 111.76 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c4a74ff6-3e4c-5e88-af36-5adc04d50688))
  (label "FB" (at 83.82 116.84 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid 4ae6449a-a859-5f16-9319-4e8be0cab0ff))
  (hierarchical_label "VOFS" (shape input) (at 63.5 142.24 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid 02fc2512-1bae-5230-aac1-17c1a076c76f))
  (label "IN_AUX" (at 142.24 114.3 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 15a36d96-2ecf-5786-bbc9-e9932169f093))
  (text "Servo (differential integrator, OPA197 on +/-5 V):\nLF 5:1 alpha = 100k/(3x300k+100k) = 0.100, Rin 1.000 Mohm,\n0.1 % 0402 string (3 x 50 V: +/-50 V peak). Tap the string at\nthe VIN pad with the first 300k, keep it off the 50R line.\nCp 18p: tap RC 90k x 26 pF = Rpar x Cint, cancels feed-through.\nLoop BW = Ga/(2 pi Rf1 Cint) = 8.8 kHz." (at 5.08 151.13 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid f9f091ac-5055-5e25-b6cb-d1dc3fe7353c))
  (text "FB node: Gsum = 1/Rf1 + 1/Rf2 + 1/Rofs = 2/Rf1\n-> LF gain alpha x Rf1 x Gsum = 0.200 (= HF gain).\nRf2 nominal 33.3k = 22.1k + RV ~11k (range -8 %..+7.6 %).\nTrim once: 1 kHz square wave, flat top LF = HF.\nVOFS (+/-0.48 V, mcu_if): OUT offset = -0.70 x VOFS\n= +/-0.33 V (+/-1.7 V at the input). Rmid of RESULT\ndropped (VOFS is centred on GND). VOFS must be quiet\nbelow 10 kHz (gain 0.7 to OUT)." (at 93.98 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 72a56ea2-83d5-5b31-899b-8ecceac3c848))
  (text "+5V: C at U101 pin 1 (VS+), pin 12 (VSO+),\nU102 pin 5; 10u bulk. 0402 at the pins, via to L2." (at 254 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid df087c00-a9ac-5771-a2d1-748a283f64f5))
  (text "-5V: C at U101 pin 5, pin 8 (VS-), pin 10 (VSO-),\nU102 pin 2; 10u bulk." (at 254 66.04 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4dde86f3-f9ff-5c41-8c53-307dc4a48305))
  (text "+2V5/-2V5 (clamp dividers): 1u at CLH/CLL nodes." (at 254 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2a60de50-8ad9-5c19-9e1e-995b2c0ad3f5))
  (hierarchical_label "EXT_CLK" (shape output) (at 55.88 223.52 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 7942c609-3109-5418-a4ca-11c304466974))
  (text "J102 EXT_CLK: 50R microstrip to TMUX136 B input (trigger_phase).\nTermination at the far end preferred; R near the SMA only as DNP option." (at 5.08 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid c6aaf225-7563-5cf7-abaa-bae84d7a3342))
  (text "Protection: no external TVS (0.3-1 pF). U101 input clamp diodes to CLH / VS- (100 mA);\nCtop limits the current (100 V/ns -> 150 mA for < 1 ns); 900k string limits servo input current.\nOverload recovery > 60 us (servo winds up, gate re-biases through 10 Mohm): RESULT open point 2.\nMax input: 1 Mohm +/-50 V peak; 50R mode 3 Vrms. Linear range +/-2.5 V around the offset.\nNoise (sim): 0.57 mV rms referred to the input, 10 Hz-2 GHz. -3 dB (50R mode) ~2-2.4 GHz (real BUF802)." (at 127 236.22 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2220010c-f970-59a0-9f6b-7e3c007b83e0))
